Z||000000||FieroLisa||02-02-2001||05:47 PM||||Well another mention of Fieros in a new magazine- but this time it's reader mail and they weren't too nice to Pontiac or the Fiero. This is on page 12 of march's issue, which I just got today:<BR>(About the Opel)... "Is this a middle class guy's Ferrari wannabe? If you build it, Americans will buy it, and in large numbers. Please GM, don't let Pontiac screw this one up"<BR>and..."I'd love to put myself into a huge amount of debt to buy a new "worthy" Opel GT, even if it were a Fiero"<P>Anyway see for yourself, just thought I'd let y'all know!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (Sold!)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
